{"version":1,"content":"<p>曾是張栢芝初戀情人的朱永棠，當年憑電影《古惑仔》「蕉皮」一角上位，早年與廣告女神譚凱欣婚後便淡出。</p><p>不過近年他逐漸復出北上發展，還分享健身影片及介紹美食，58歲的他被網民大讚不但未有發福，反而腹肌緊實，保養甚佳明顯回春不少。</p><p>&lt;br/&amp;g</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T04:21:31.701852+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T04:01:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T04:18:15.757666+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T04:18:15.757666+00:00","content_hash":"b014b28fbc4b3598309e4f3b11c41976b9d4c3ce4c62db9574ff661ff291e82f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}